sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as User
    box rgb(232,240,254) Layer 1 Presentation
        participant R as auth_routes
    end
    box rgb(232,245,233) Layer 2 Application
        participant A as AuthService
    end
    box rgb(255,243,224) Layer 3 Data access and integration
        participant U as UserRepository
        participant H as PasswordHasher
    end
    box rgb(243,229,245) Layer 4 External systems
        participant DB as PostgreSQL
    end

    S->>R: POST /login (email, password)
    R->>A: login(email, password)
    A->>U: find_by_email(email)
    U->>DB: SELECT user WHERE lower(email) = ?
    alt user not found
        A-->>R: raise AuthenticationError
    else user found
        A->>U: get_password_hash(user_id)
        U->>DB: SELECT password_hash
        A->>H: verify(password_hash, password)
        alt wrong password
            A-->>R: raise AuthenticationError
        else password correct and account not verified
            A-->>R: raise EmailNotVerifiedError
            R-->>S: page with "Resend verification code"
        else password correct and account verified
            A->>A: create signed session token
            A-->>R: token
            R->>R: store token in Secure, HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax cookie
            R-->>S: 303 redirect by role (Find Events or Facility Management)
        end
    end
    Note over R,S: AuthenticationError always shows "Invalid e-mail or password"
